
  <sn><md>### `const` Keyword in C

`const` is a **keyword in C** used to declare an object whose value **cannot be modified through that object after initialization**.

**Definition**

&gt; **`const` specifies that the value of an object should not be modified after it has been initialized.**
</md></sn>
